{
  "name": "Day11B: Tool Calling Decision LOCKED",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Objective\n\n- Why LLMs need tools\n- What tool calling is\n- Difference between prompting vs tool use\n- How an agent decides which tool to invoke\n- Tool schemas\n- AI-generated structured actions\n- Multi-tool routing\n\n### Highlights\n- multiple Agents can share the same LLM.\n- The Context is owned by the agent (not the LLM)\n\n\nNote: *that this is not yet about memory or multi-agent systems—that comes later.*\n\n#[Guide](https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/components/sticky-notes/)",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 432
